  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Weather and Climate Information Services (WISER Africa) - CDEL</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UK&#x2019;s flagship Weather and Climate Information Services (WISER) programme, delivered in partnership with the UK-based Met Office, improves the capacity of climate vulnerable countries and communities, particularly women and the most marginalised, to forecast and respond to climate and weather extremes. This specific component is solely for CDEL budget.</narrative>
  </description>
